sequenceDiagram
  participant AgentLoop as Agent Loop
  participant Model as LLM
  participant Hook as Hooks
  participant Tool as Tool
  participant Ctx as Context

  AgentLoop->>Model: messages + tools
  Model-->>AgentLoop: assistant content: toolCall
  AgentLoop->>AgentLoop: find tool by name
  AgentLoop->>AgentLoop: prepareArguments 兼容参数
  AgentLoop->>AgentLoop: validateToolArguments 校验 schema
  AgentLoop->>Hook: beforeToolCall
  Hook-->>AgentLoop: allow / block / rewrite
  AgentLoop->>Tool: execute(toolCallId, params, signal)
  Tool-->>AgentLoop: AgentToolResult
  AgentLoop->>Hook: afterToolCall
  Hook-->>AgentLoop: optional override / terminate
  AgentLoop->>Ctx: append toolResult
  AgentLoop->>Model: next request





